ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Xi and Jiang Yang are the leaders of the community activity preparation group. They are deciding the theme of the next community activity. Ming Ai is a new member of the preparation group, today is her first time participating in the activity discussion meeting. While waiting for her turn to speak, Ming Ai keeps flipping through the documents in front of her, Jiang Yang, with a smile on his face, looks at Zhang Xi, then at Ming Ai. Then Zhang Xi puts down the document, nods at Jiang Yang with a smile, and walks towards Ming Ai. Ming Ai sees all their actions.\n\n[Question]\nHow do you think Ming Ai feels?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Ming Ai feels nervous at first, then a bit confused, not understanding what Jiang Yang is coming to do.\nB. Ming Ai feels a bit guilty, she thinks she disturbs Jiang Yang and others by flipping through the documents.\nC. Ming Ai feels excluded and isolated because Jiang Yang and Zhang Xi interact behind her back.\nD. Ming Ai possibly feels disappointed because Jiang Yang comes to prevent her from speaking on stage.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182639895476295,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58e429aa9dc5a833d60ae","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477634915,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:00:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"44c8648f8dda4a2fb21d0713dfee0cc5"}